	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S. D.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Misi d. <persName>Philippo</persName> Biblia Latina; probabit ea, <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>sat scio, et excipiet cum gaudio; est enim liber elegans <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>et mundus.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salutabis ipsum meo nomine humanis<lb xml:id="p1z4"/>sime.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Rediit <placeName ref="l157">Francfordia</placeName> ac foro <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>usus est felici satis; attulit secum libellos aliquot <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>Germanicos, unum cuiusdam <persName>Ioachimi Magdeburgii</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>qui scripsit Veterem et novum Christum; fingit autem <lb xml:id="p1z8"/><persName ref="p1974">Lutherum</persName> cum suis veterem praedicare, novum confinxis<lb xml:id="p1z9"/>se Berengarium et novum Christum annunciare sacramentarios.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z10"/>Dicas totum librum esse plaustrum convitiorum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Attu<lb xml:id="p1z11"/>lit et <persName>Philippi</persName> purgationem contra <persName>Staphylum</persName> et <persName>Anium <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>Coloniensem</persName>, folia duntaxat 3. Attulit aliam <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>quoque apologiam <persName ref="p2104">Iusti Menii</persName>, ministri <placeName ref="l284">Lipsensis</placeName>, contra <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>Illyricum et Amsdorffium.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Conspuunt se mutuum <placeName>Saxones</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z15"/>Iudicio dei iusto hoc fieri nihil dubito; interim <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>vero offenduntur plurimi.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Fama est electoris <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>demortui filios tueri istos alastores et rabios<lb xml:id="p1z18"/>os rixososque canes, rursus vero alios principes <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>evangelicos graviter postulare, ut deiiciant rixator<lb xml:id="p1z20"/>es istos.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Quid futurum sit, alias audiemus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Mos<lb xml:id="p1z21"/>covitae dicuntur irruisse in <placeName>Livoniam</placeName> vicinaque loca <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>et vastasse multa oppida et pagos plurimos occidisseque <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>permultos et multo plures abduxisse captivos.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="de">Der <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>bischoff von <placeName>Labach</placeName>, alls er von dem nüwen rö<lb xml:id="p1z25"/>mischen keysser wöllen scheyden zuͦ <placeName ref="l119">Tonawerd</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>ist die stäg hinabgeschossen und zuͦ todt gefallen.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z27"/>Dicitur iam et <persName>Illyricus</persName> esse mortuus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="de">Der bischoff zuͦ <lb xml:id="p1z28"/><placeName ref="l1030">Würtzburg</placeName> in <placeName>Francken</placeName> ist vor der statt am Mayn <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>by der prucken erschossen, sin cantzler ouch und <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>ettlich mitt imm.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="de">Es ist ein wunderfrävvle historia.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z31"/>Die <placeName ref="l830">Engellender</placeName> habend ein gwalltige armada zuͦ<lb xml:id="p1z32"/>gerüst uff dem meer zuͦ <placeName>Calles</placeName>, dem <placeName ref="l832">Franzosen</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>zuͦ werren, das er nitt hinüber den <placeName ref="l2524">Schotten</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>zuͦ hilff schiffe, und gryffend sy, die <placeName ref="l830">Engellender</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>mitt macht uff die <placeName ref="l2524">Schotten</placeName> an, habend 4000 Tüt<lb xml:id="p1z36"/>scher angenommen und ouch hinyn von <placeName ref="l15">Antorff</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>gefertiget.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="de">Die <placeName ref="l2524">Schotten</placeName> hattend wöllen <placeName ref="l3029">War<lb xml:id="p1z38"/>wick</placeName> belägern; aber sy sind mitt iren hälfferen, <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>den <placeName ref="l832">Franzosen</placeName>, die in <placeName ref="l2524">Schotten</placeName> wider <placeName ref="l830">Engelland</placeName> lygend, un<lb xml:id="p1z40"/>eins worden und wider hinder sich zogen.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="de">Der könig <lb xml:id="p1z41"/><persName ref="p3590">Philipps</persName> sol ouch mitt macht uff den <placeName ref="l832">Franzosen</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z42"/>ziehen, das er den Schotten dister minder hälffen möge.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Alii de pace dicunt.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><lb xml:id="p1z43"/>Haec communica cum d. <persName ref="p8432">Friderycho a Salice</persName>, quem <lb xml:id="p1z44"/>et salutabis.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">Valebis cum nostris omnibus, consulibus imprimis.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><lb xml:id="p1z45"/>Salutant te nostri omnes.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName> 29. aprilis 1558.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z46"/>Miror, quod filius meus <persName>Patavio</persName> non venit etc.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z47"/><persName ref="p495">Bullingerus</persName> tuus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Praestantissimo viro d. <persName ref="p8009">Io<lb xml:id="p2z2"/>anni Fabritio</persName>, <placeName ref="l98">Curiensis</placeName> <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>ecclesiae ministro, com<lb xml:id="p2z4"/>patri et fratri meo charissimo.</s>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z5"/>Chur.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
